  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Poverty Reduction Monitoring &amp; Evaluation IDF Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activities (the Activities) for which the Grant is given are as follows: (a) Poverty Reduction Strategy Monitoring and Evaluation Provision of technical assistance for the development of the methodology for monitoring and evaluation of the poverty reduction strategy; conducting consultative workshops in each Judet to build up consensus for the new methodology and Judets level poverty reduction strategies; and provision of computer equipment to local offices of CASPIS in Judets. (b) Results Dissemination Provision of support for the dissemination of monitoring and evaluation results of the poverty reduction strategy through workshops and production of printed documents. (c) Program Support Provision of office equipment,  supplies and administrative support to the CASPIS.</narrative>
  </description>
